  "description": "Enterprise-grade fully managed RocketMQ client with dual-protocol support for Remoting 4.x/5.x and gRPC 5.x Proxy. Zero external dependencies, unified cloud adapters, and complete enterprise features. 企业级纯托管 RocketMQ 客户端，双协议支持，零外部依赖，统一适配阿里云、华为云、腾讯云及 Apache ACL，完整企业级特性。",
